WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.459 --> 00:00:06.330
We did a segment last week before Thanksgiving,
might have been the week before about how

00:00:06.330 --> 00:00:12.719
Fox News has been so effective at radicalizing
their own viewers that Fox News viewers are

00:00:12.719 --> 00:00:17.159
now turning on Fox because Fox isn't radical
enough.

00:00:17.159 --> 00:00:19.369
And the context was election results.

00:00:19.369 --> 00:00:24.119
As you saw, there are some Fox anchors, Chris
Wallace, Neil Cavuto, Eric Sean.

00:00:24.119 --> 00:00:29.769
They acknowledge that Joe Biden won the election
and you saw furious Trump supporters abandoned

00:00:29.769 --> 00:00:34.609
Fox, along with Trump himself promoting even
more radical and farcical news sources.

00:00:34.609 --> 00:00:36.670
018 and Newsmax.

00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:41.179
And our friend Molly Jong fast wrote a piece
about this in The Daily Beast.

00:00:41.179 --> 00:00:42.280
It's worth checking out.

00:00:42.280 --> 00:00:47.539
It's called Fox News is no longer insane enough
for Fox viewers.

00:00:47.539 --> 00:00:51.289
And she writes, They built a huge outrage
machine.

00:00:51.289 --> 00:00:56.440
Then some of them tried to be real news people
for five minutes and now the.

00:00:56.440 --> 00:00:59.309
Rage Machine is outraged at them.

00:00:59.309 --> 00:01:04.500
This is the irony, I think the phrase that
applies is if you fly too close to the sun,

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:06.869
you will get burned or something like that.

00:01:06.869 --> 00:01:08.790
They created this.

00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:12.700
They told their audience, you can't trust
the media when they say things that don't

00:01:12.700 --> 00:01:14.580
sound right about right wingers.

00:01:14.580 --> 00:01:17.960
And you've got to be outraged when you were
told those things.

00:01:17.960 --> 00:01:24.590
And now their viewers are seeing Fox sometimes
report accurately that Joe Biden won.

00:01:24.590 --> 00:01:29.159
And so they're furious with Fox and they don't
trust Fox and they're looking for something

00:01:29.159 --> 00:01:30.159
else.

00:01:30.159 --> 00:01:31.330
They were chanting.

00:01:31.330 --> 00:01:37.270
Fox News sucks at various protests over the
election results in the days after the November

00:01:37.270 --> 00:01:38.299
3rd election.

00:01:38.299 --> 00:01:43.080
And Molly writes in this article, quote, But
the problem is that Fox had built an audience

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:49.250
that had gotten more and more radicalized
with each passing year by Fox's content.

00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:54.840
So by election night, when Fox anchor suddenly
wanted to play things straight, it created

00:01:54.840 --> 00:02:01.310
a phenomenon whereby Fox News was unable to
keep up with the conservative outrage generated

00:02:01.310 --> 00:02:03.270
by Fox News.

00:02:03.270 --> 00:02:05.590
And this is exactly right.

00:02:05.590 --> 00:02:10.580
And part of it is that you still have on Fox
News itself people promoting and supporting

00:02:10.580 --> 00:02:12.410
Trump's voter fraud theories.

00:02:12.410 --> 00:02:14.610
This is part of the radicalization.

00:02:14.610 --> 00:02:15.860
Fox's opinion.

00:02:15.860 --> 00:02:21.000
People have radicalized their viewers against
anyone telling them Trump lost it.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:24.850
Just so happens, there are also people on
Fox News telling them that Trump lost.

00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:30.330
We looked at clips earlier from Maria Bartiromo
indistinguishable from a North Korean state

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:34.290
media anchor reporting news about Kim Jong
un.

00:02:34.290 --> 00:02:39.100
And at the same time, we have Eric Shawn saying,
well, Biden won and there's no evidence of

00:02:39.100 --> 00:02:41.160
the fraud Trump claims exist.

00:02:41.160 --> 00:02:45.030
So this is where we start wondering about
the future of Fox.

00:02:45.030 --> 00:02:50.240
You might see a fracturing of the agenda setters
in right wing media where Fox News sets the

00:02:50.240 --> 00:02:54.580
agenda maybe for what we'd call more traditional
reactionary ideas.

00:02:54.580 --> 00:02:59.780
And then the stuff of the last few weeks,
the Kuhnen stuff, the types protesting elections,

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:03.650
they may be fracture off to OCN or Newsmax.

00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:07.680
It may all change after January 20th when
Joe Biden is elected.

00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:09.160
It all remains to be seen.

00:03:09.160 --> 00:03:15.900
But the important takeaway here is Fox itself
is to blame for this, at least in part.

00:03:15.900 --> 00:03:23.970
They created a safe space for fact free, baseless
nonsense for years, which they attempted to

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:25.980
present as news.

00:03:25.980 --> 00:03:30.140
This is the best that they have made and maybe
they will suffer financially from it.

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:31.140
I don't know.

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:34.710
But it will be very interesting to see what
the right wing media landscape looks in.

00:03:34.710 --> 00:03:39.250
For example, six months, a few months into
Joe Biden's presidency.

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:44.260
Once vaccines have been rolled out for coronavirus,
where will the conspiracies lie?

00:03:44.260 --> 00:03:45.650
What will Fox look like?

00:03:45.650 --> 00:03:48.000
What will on and Newsmax look like?

00:03:48.000 --> 00:05:22.490
We can only wait 

00:05:22.490 --> 00:05:29.050
and see.

